{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"ab4129f7da296c2ef1231ef6b269d1001d9762f3986ad9b1f1376e712a887f37","ja":"大食いチャレンジ","zh":"大胃王挑战","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"d178c9cb19b554ce9a5fe31a79199c2ef2bd73a9e9f60d3754f2a3a365dc01f2","ja":"「宣伝時間を懸けた大食いチャレンジ！\n今回挑むのは……5人のアイドルのみなさんです！」","zh":"「赌上宣传时间的大胃王挑战！\n这次前来挑战的是……5位偶像！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43","ja":"よろしくお願いします！","zh":"请多关照！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d3a125b0e770d7f82e87b7a9d2d1d2f26bd01ab68f0c64dfe9c21b2d9a76ea5f","ja":"「では、今日のチャレンジについて、\n意気込みを聞かせてください！」","zh":"「那么，对于今天的挑战，\n请谈谈您的干劲吧！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8044f94c6804f8e6c7bb8b47a0d53386aab67cc930bcfc25ce962016a1f4221c","ja":"このチャレンジのために、今日はお昼を抜いて、\nばっちりお腹を空かせてきました～！","zh":"为了这项挑战，我今天连午饭都没吃，\n已经彻底把肚子空出来了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"8426c289e14d9c3a9f26b25d4cd46897533cf4aa22967a9c1a4aea5958cb72ed","ja":"私も今日に備えて、\nしっかり体調を整えてきました！","zh":"我也为了今天，\n好好地调整了身体状态！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0ecacb2855b9c7eb8e507df137313048e6f3e574430606a191d9dd6dad674c6c","ja":"他のみんなも、朝からここまで\n一緒に歩いてきたんだよ。","zh":"其他所有人，也是从早上开始\n一起走到这里的哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d60f2a77da059f674d183872ca0308297fde3ae58a8321fcbba7f02b552dac2c","ja":"少しでも長く私達の公演が宣伝できるように、\n全力を尽くしたいと思います！","zh":"为了能让我们的公演宣传得更久哪怕一点点，\n我都会全力以赴的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"be6756e7abf498c59cd3d97327d506de656f3fb5fb9089e8ce5cbed8f650bb3e","ja":"ワタシ達、今日は完食が目標だからネ♪\nお腹がはち切れそうになっても食べ続けるヨ！","zh":"我们今天的目标可是全部吃光呢♪\n就算肚子快撑爆了也要继续吃下去唷！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"e1f8459a90111589e8242df61237c930f95c46e3df158ee97cff50f0e34574d3","ja":"そういえば、\n今日のチャレンジ料理って何だろう？","zh":"话说回来，\n今天的挑战料理是什么呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"c08eed0c10d4568eeb71558ca668bcf7958744885f08452872b8ad24887744c7","ja":"私は、スイーツだと嬉しいです。\n別腹パワーで食べきれるかも♪","zh":"如果是甜点的话，我会很开心的。\n靠甜点胃的力量，说不定能吃完呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"41f8e5be69564b1b5e1e63486f63cd3a277dbaff814f1c8e98a7fca767e8deb1","ja":"丼とかじゃなければいいな。\nご飯って、意外とお腹に溜まるんだよね～。","zh":"希望不是盖饭之类的就好。\n米饭其实还挺顶饱的呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1457.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"c482310c6c6d42a41a5e253ee5095e85c0abbeac8a80c060b6a1e59b7c97188b","ja":"「それは見てのお楽しみということで！\nそれでは、チャレンジ料理の登場です！」","zh":"“那就敬请期待吧！\n那么，挑战料理登场！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
